{"posts":[{"id":"finddecision_p3_51","t":"benhur\n\nHere is my work on decision points.\n\nIt was drilling for decision points from AUDUSD D1 chart.\n\nOne thing I discovered is that I maximum had to drill down to H1 to get the cause for price to change its direction.\n\nAll comments are welcome:::\n\n2231","a":"—","d":"","n":"#51","p":3,"im":["fa233abc6a8921cd152f68429056fbd9d3c27cfe"],"m":51},{"id":"finddecision_p3_52","t":"benhur\n\n2231","a":"—","d":"","n":"#52","p":3,"im":["1eade59d09ee72f640ed17fa5ff61505eea610e1"],"m":52},{"id":"finddecision_p3_53","t":"benhur\n\n2231","a":"—","d":"","n":"#53","p":3,"im":["c79618ca627dab3c9f67f74b76a4bc71a2810dc5"],"m":53},{"id":"finddecision_p3_54","t":"benhur\n\n2231","a":"—","d":"","n":"#54","p":3,"im":["88099fb585331f4dabaef865e8ebd61cf1c66315"],"m":54},{"id":"finddecision_p3_55","t":"benhur\n\n2231","a":"—","d":"","n":"#55","p":3,"im":["ffda0ba2d9462f39bc41ade32496e820c445e424"],"m":55},{"id":"finddecision_p3_56","t":"benhur\n\n2231","a":"—","d":"","n":"#56","p":3,"im":["30aca859c960a00de074a64869ff483dc371e284"],"m":56},{"id":"finddecision_p3_57","t":"benhur\n\n2231","a":"—","d":"","n":"#57","p":3,"im":["51be2f0568d57054cdf79e4b48771838d006687c"],"m":57},{"id":"finddecision_p3_58","t":"benhur\n\n2231","a":"—","d":"","n":"#58","p":3,"im":["67430c61c02ea1fedafaa13dc4d93c9084a48819"],"m":58},{"id":"finddecision_p3_59","t":"benhur\n\n2231","a":"—","d":"","n":"#59","p":3,"im":["58d77262c0e6ff646a23f0474c4bffac1678591e"],"m":59},{"id":"finddecision_p3_60","t":"benhur\n\n2231","a":"—","d":"","n":"#60","p":3,"im":["d420a80be3f0401880558f858e609f6589c908bf"],"m":60},{"id":"finddecision_p3_61","t":"benhur\n\n2231","a":"—","d":"","n":"#61","p":3,"im":["17e4e4be16050bb4c3eb1ea3ee88ca21c8e78b66"],"m":61},{"id":"finddecision_p3_62","t":"This will be alot like the Read a Session Homework, except that I want you to do learn from it how to pinpoint in advance, turns in the market which will pay you very large rewards for minimal risk.\n\nSo Open a D1 chart on any pair Download as much LTF history as you can for it\n\nVisitor\n\nStart at the second price turn on the left Look to the left of it, in the lowest TF you can Work out why price reacted to that level Mark the reason on the LTF chart Take a little screenshot of that area - name it \"name of pair\"1 Mark the turning point on D1 with a 1 Move on to the next turning point, and repeat, and then the next. Do this for every turning point. When you're finished, you'll have a D1 chart with all the turning points numbered, and a gallery of thumbnails of the LTFs, each explaining the turns.\n\nDo this for as many pairs as you possibly can\n\nBelieve me, it'll be well worth it!","a":"—","d":"","n":"#62","p":3,"im":[],"m":62},{"id":"finddecision_p3_63","t":"Ashkan\n\nHello guys\n\nHere is EURUSD daily chart. I’m trying to find out why price reacted to marked levels. Feel free comment on my charts.\n\nRegards, Ashkan","a":"—","d":"","n":"#63","p":3,"im":["99a4372da52df2d59f0fe72d550f21f4080f7a17"],"m":63},{"id":"finddecision_p3_64","t":"Ashkan","a":"—","d":"","n":"#64","p":3,"im":["c02e67a99b1d9f5517fcbff9f4a92d563cb563c6"],"m":64},{"id":"finddecision_p3_65","t":"Ashkan","a":"—","d":"","n":"#65","p":3,"im":["db200a40791cb4b4deaa71fd15a74b69f139e1ef"],"m":65},{"id":"finddecision_p3_66","t":"Ashkan","a":"—","d":"","n":"#66","p":3,"im":["6cb50234d599b8ff96f312717fb70a3858292b88"],"m":66},{"id":"finddecision_p3_67","t":"Ashkan","a":"—","d":"","n":"#67","p":3,"im":["51c5c03706e775dc4b29abf2ccc3f0070e6a2639"],"m":67},{"id":"finddecision_p3_68","t":"Ashkan","a":"—","d":"","n":"#68","p":3,"im":["d4bbc464e214b66779f2bc284563667a23a40d92"],"m":68},{"id":"finddecision_p3_69","t":"Ashkan","a":"—","d":"","n":"#69","p":3,"im":["66bafc94a1e57d204153569511ba64982f9516ad"],"m":69},{"id":"finddecision_p3_70","t":"Ashkan","a":"—","d":"","n":"#70","p":3,"im":["5bf57c4237c4500964f3045b6efcbffaef105b13"],"m":70},{"id":"finddecision_p3_71","t":"Ashkan","a":"—","d":"","n":"#71